[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Parser Profiles
[/meta]

h1. Parser Profiles

Tests for Section 23 of the specification.

h2. Inline Profile

h3. Inline formatting without a paragraph {#profiles-inline-formatting}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
*bold* and _italic_
[/code]
[code html]
<strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em>
[/code]

h3. Links, escapes and language spans {#profiles-inline-links}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
[Visit]:www.example.com, \*literal\*, [lang fr]bonjour[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<a href="https://www.example.com">Visit</a>, *literal*, <span lang="fr">bonjour</span>
[/code]

h3. A newline is an error on the line after the break {#profiles-inline-newline}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
One
Two
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 2
[/code]

h3. Lists are not allowed {#profiles-inline-list}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
* item
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Headings are not allowed {#profiles-inline-heading}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
h2. Title
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Short form quotes are not allowed {#profiles-inline-short-quote}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
> quoted
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h2. Basic Profile

h3. Everything the basic profile allows {#profiles-basic-allowed}
; profile
: basic
```om
Para *one*.

* item

[code]
x
[/code]

[quote]
Quoted.
[/quote]

> Short.

---
```
[code html]
<p>Para <strong>one</strong>.</p>
<ul>
<li>item</li>
</ul>
<pre><code>x
</code></pre>
<blockquote>
<p>Quoted.</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>Short.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
[/code]

h3. Tables are not allowed {#profiles-basic-table}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
| a | b |
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Definition lists are not allowed {#profiles-basic-definitions}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
; Term
: Definition
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Language blocks are not allowed {#profiles-basic-lang-block}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
[lang fr]
Bonjour.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Footnote references are not allowed {#profiles-basic-fn-ref}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
A claim[fn1].
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Language spans are allowed {#profiles-basic-lang-span}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
Say [lang fr]bonjour[/lang].
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Say <span lang="fr">bonjour</span>.</p>
[/code]

h2. Standard Profile

h3. Everything the standard profile adds {#profiles-standard-allowed}
; profile
: standard
[code om]
h2. Title

|| A ||
| 1 |

[note]
Text.
[/note]

; Term
: Definition

[more Open]
Hidden.
[/more]

[comment]
Gone.
[/comment]

[lang fr]
Bonjour.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<h2 id="title">Title</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th scope="col">A</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>1</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div role="note" class="note">
<p>Text.</p>
</div>
<dl>
<dt>Term</dt>
<dd>Definition</dd>
</dl>
<details>
<summary>Open</summary>
<p>Hidden.</p>
</details>
<div lang="fr">
<p>Bonjour.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Footnote references are not allowed {#profiles-standard-fn-ref}
; profile
: standard
[code om]
A claim[fn1].
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. Footnote blocks are not allowed {#profiles-standard-fn}
; profile
: standard
[code om]
[fn]
1. Note.
[/fn]
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h2. Full Profile

h3. Full is the default {#profiles-full-default}
[code om]
[meta]
lang: en
[/meta]

[toc]

h2. One
[/code]
[code html]
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#one">One</a></li>
</ol>
</nav>
<h2 id="one">One</h2>
[/code]
